        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"7d432d3b-439e-4096-a403-cd89d6dabdf0\",\"review_text\":\"I loved this app I can listen to every song I want to listen and they even have very nice playlist 😄😄\"},{\"review_id\":\"290b55dd-0271-4eef-a9cc-d9c94f22a3e7\",\"review_text\":\"superb\"},{\"review_id\":\"ebabbc3b-c185-4d3a-be8e-ded017dc8eba\",\"review_text\":\"👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻👌🏻❣️❣️❣️❣️❣️❣️❣️❣️💞💕\"},{\"review_id\":\"fd636bb6-54dd-4499-932d-c692ade4151a\",\"review_text\":\"Nice to listen to music when my phone is off\"},{\"review_id\":\"0712f878-0890-49a1-a03b-5c05bf9241ed\",\"review_text\":\"I love this app,, because it helps me to locate music real quick\"},{\"review_id\":\"6ccb1b70-c4de-4a9a-adac-9a998a569457\",\"review_text\":\"Fine enjoyable music app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"95070e27-9b94-41ac-8fe5-cd3566b45bd7\",\"review_text\":\"Best app for me\"},{\"review_id\":\"e7382d3b-9d14-41d2-a0f6-e7fd568d227c\",\"review_text\":\"normally i dont have problems with the app but lately its not responding but over all its good\"},{\"review_id\":\"0f1d7211-cd8d-4264-a433-2a5511bba7a1\",\"review_text\":\"Premium user. Loved this app for a long time until the recent update. They make you jump through hoops to buy audiobooks and now that doesnt work. Tried sending support an email, that glitches out too. What a joke of customer support\"},{\"review_id\":\"d6ef2742-20a1-4381-a1c6-de8b471bf939\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify is trying to do it's best to make a music listening for us difficult I can't stop shuffle and there are so many ads I am just tired of this app\"}]}"
